        },
        {
          "text": " Kwaŋin kodaun aswam naeswamakini Solomon etogo loka EJAKAIT. Kitoloma Solomon iboro luabu Daudi papake kotiaku; epuesa ka esa bu, ka iboro kere, kibwaik kes aiŋadisia nuka etogo loka Edeke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
