            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi do kanen, keraut ikakutak arupepen ka ikayook bala ediopet, aisiirario eporoto ediopet aiturit ka aimal EJAKAIT; kitonyoutu kesi iporotoikec nepepe karupepen ka aisinin nueruosi ka lueruosi kere, kituritos EJAKAIT ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
